  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "PostProcessingPass implements the retro filter effect within the rendering pipeline, adhering to the IRenderPass interface. It manages WebGL resources, specifically initializing a Shader for fullscreen quad rendering. The execute method applies visual distortions like chromatic aberration and flickering by manipulating uniforms such as u_time and u_distortionStrength on the input texture. It is responsible for integrating the final rendered texture into the aesthetic post-processing stage."
  },
